<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-SRI LANKA (269 TO WIN) 97-2 V WINDIES - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA (269 TO WIN) 97-2 V WINDIES - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, needing 269 to win the second and final test against West Indies, were 97-2 at the close on the fourth day on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 343, Sri Lanka 222  and 97-2.</p>
